<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>62.0</apiVersion>
    <actionCalls>
        <name>Call_Send_Customer_Notification</name>
        <label>Send Customer Notification 호출</label>
        <locationX>264</locationX>
        <locationY>566</locationY>
        <actionName>SendCustomerNotification</actionName>
        <actionType>apex</actionType>
        <flowTransactionModel>CurrentTransaction</flowTransactionModel>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>workOrderId</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
    </actionCalls>
    <decisions>
        <name>Determine_New_Status</name>
        <label>새 상태 판별</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>350</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>기타 상태(알림 없음)</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Status_En_Route</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Status__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>En Route</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Call_Send_Customer_Notification</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>En Route로 변경됨</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Status_On_Site</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Status__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>On Site</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Call_Send_Customer_Notification</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>On Site로 변경됨</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Status_Completed</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Status__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Completed</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Call_Send_Customer_Notification</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Completed로 변경됨</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Work_Order__c의 Status__c가 변경될 때(En Route/On Site/Completed) 고객에게 알림을 발송합니다.

[하이브리드 설계 결정 로그]
- 이 Flow는 &quot;언제, 어떤 상태 변경에 대해&quot; 알림을 트리거할지를 선언적으로 표현한다(비개발 담당자도 Flow Builder에서 분기 조건을 읽고 수정 가능하다).
- 실제 발송(외부 Messaging API 콜아웃)은 Apex(SendCustomerNotification -&gt; CustomerNotificationQueueable)에 위임한다. 이유:
  1) Flow의 선언형 액션만으로는 Named Credential 인증, 비동기 Queueable 처리, 실패 시 Integration_Log__c 기록 같은 견고성 요구사항을 조합하기 어렵다.
  2) 콜아웃 로직을 Apex로 격리하면 HttpCalloutMock 기반 단위 테스트로 회귀 위험을 낮출 수 있다.
  3) 메시지 문안이나 재시도 정책이 바뀌어도 Flow 재배포 없이 Apex 클래스만 수정하면 된다.
- 즉 &quot;조건/분기&quot;는 선언형(Flow)에 남기고 &quot;콜아웃·인증·로깅&quot;은 코드(Apex)로 캡슐화하는 하이브리드 자동화 패턴이다.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>WorkOrder Status Notification {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>WorkOrder Status Notification</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>OriginBuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <start>
        <locationX>50</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Determine_New_Status</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterFormula>ISCHANGED({!$Record.Status__c})</filterFormula>
        <object>Work_Order__c</object>
        <recordTriggerType>Update</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordAfterSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
</Flow>
